# autocam/ moved to a top-level folder and now holds real server code
# ($autocam/stepProfile.js, turning.js, routing.js, drive_watcher.js etc.,
# imported directly by src/routes/api/*/+server.js via the $autocam alias
# in svelte.config.js) - excluding it here broke every Cloud Build image
# build with ENOENT on those imports, since `COPY . .` in the Dockerfile
# respects this file. Do not re-exclude the whole folder; if a narrower
# exclude is ever wanted, scope it to the exact non-runtime paths and verify
# with a real `docker build` first - this exact mistake is easy to reintroduce
# by accident.
